[l_english.STATE_LORE_481]
Fillydelphia is the second largest city in eastern Equestria, second only to Manehattan. After the Ultimate Battle, the wealthy merchants here were ecstatic to receive commissioners from the Royal Committee: they had long been secretly maintaining their commercial empire under Celestia’s rule, fearing that one day their monopoly and exploitation would be deemed “disharmonious” and punished. With the collapse of the Canterlot regime and the loss of contact with Manehattan, they finally had the opportunity to expand their business empire without restrictions. However, their dreams were shattered quickly — soon they realized that the Royal Committee was just a shell, and the new Empress Cozy Glow behind it was even more terrifying than Celestia. If they could operate with integrity, treat their employees well, and abide by the law, then at least they can survive and develop steadily under Celestia’s rule. However, under Cozy Glow’s rule, they must be politically, economically, and even in hobbies consistent with this little tyrant, otherwise they will be considered “opposing the Empress of Friendship” and be purged.
Therefore, Fillydelphia chose to lean towards the reopened Manehattan. Although Gladmane is also a subordinate of Cozy Glow, he is the “Underground King” of the Manehattan mafia at the same time. He can use his financial resources and network to corrupt imperial officials and ensure the misdeeds of the wealthy merchants in Fillydelphia go unpunished. Many well-known enterprises in Fillydelphia chose to cooperate with Gladmane or were acquired by the Gladmane Group, becoming a member of the “Manehattan Business Alliance”. These enterprises, under Gladmane’s protection, continued to grow wildly under Cozy Glow’s rule, and Gladmane also gained more support in the underground world of Manehattan as a result.

[l_simp_chinese.STATE_LORE_481]
小马德菲亚是小马利亚东部第二大城市，仅次于马哈顿。在终末之战后，这里的富商们欣喜若狂地接受了来自皇家委员会的委员：他们长久以来在塞拉斯蒂娅的统治下小心翼翼地偷偷摸摸维护着自己的商业帝国，生怕有一天他们的垄断与压榨生意会被判定为“不符合谐律”而被查封。随着坎特洛特政权的崩溃、马哈顿的失联，他们终于有机会无限制地扩张自己的商业版图。不过他们的梦想破灭的很快 —— 不久后，他们就意识到皇家委员会不过是一个壳子，背后的新晋女皇和煦光流比塞拉斯蒂娅更加可怕。如果说，只要诚信经营、善待员工、遵守法律，他们就能在塞拉斯蒂娅的统治下安稳地发展，那么在和煦光流的统治下，他们必须要在政治上、经济上、甚至是爱好上都要与这位小小暴君保持一致，否则就会被视为“反对友谊女皇”而被清算。
于是，小马德菲亚选择倒向了重新开放的马哈顿。虽然乐善也听命于和煦光流，但他是马哈顿黑社会的“地下国王”。他可以动用其财力和关系网来拉拢帝国官员，保障各位小马德菲亚富商的胡作非为。小马德菲亚的不少知名企业选择与乐善达成合作关系，或者被乐善集团收购，成为了“马哈顿商业联盟”的一分子。这些企业在乐善的保护下，得以在和煦光流的统治下继续野蛮生长，而乐善也因此在马哈顿的地下世界中获得了更多的支持。
